    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arcānus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		Arcae, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to Arcœ</i>
			hence, <i>subst.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arcāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Arcœ</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 4007</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arcānum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>a villa of Q.
				Cicero</i>, <i>in the neighborhood of
				Arcœ</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 5, 1</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id. ad Q. Fr. 3, 1 al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
